{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 31, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the Land of the Rising Sun a most wondrous quest I shall now pen for thee.\n\n**Day First Arrival in Tokyo a Metropolis Bright**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth arrive\nAt Narita's gate where new adventures thrive.\nTo Shinjuku's heights a taxi swift shall bear\nA hotel grand a haven free from care.\nThen wander streets of neon light and sound\nWhere ramen stalls and bustling crowds abound.\nA dinner feast of sushi fresh and bold\nA tale to tell as days unfold.\n\n**Day Second Tokyo's Ancient Heart**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall make haste\nSenso-ji's grace a beauty unsurpassed.\nThrough Nakamise-dori we'll gently stroll\nFor trinkets charms and stories to extol.\nThen Ueno Park a verdant space to see\nWith museums grand for all eternity.\nThe Tokyo National Museum's halls so deep\nWhere history's secrets softly sleep.\n\n**Day Third Hakone's Mountain Majesty**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone we now take\nWhere mountains rise and crystal waters break.\nA cruise upon Lake Ashi serene and blue\nWith views of Fuji's peak a wondrous view.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum's artful grace\nWhere sculptures meet the landscape's gentle face.\nA volcanic hot spring a soothing balm\nTo ease thy cares and keep thy spirit calm.\n\n**Day Fourth Kyoto's Imperial Charm**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto we shall fly\nA city steeped in history drawing nigh.\nTo Gion's district where geishas softly tread\nA glimpse of elegance a vision spread.\nKiyomizu-dera Temple's wooden stage\nA panoramic vista age on age.\nThen Fushimi Inari's gates a vibrant hue\nA thousand torii leading ever true.\n\n**Day Fifth Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor gold so bright\nReflecting in the pond a dazzling sight.\nRyoan-ji's garden stones a mystic art\nTo ponder peace and play a mindful part.\nNijo Castle where shoguns once did reign\nA testament to power and to pain.\nA tea ceremony a ritual refined\nA moment's grace for body soul and mind.\n\n**Day Sixth Nara's Deer and Temples Old**\n\nTo Nara town a short and easy ride\nWhere friendly deer roam freely far and wide.\nTodai-ji Temple housing Buddha grand\nA marvel built by skillful artisan hand.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine with lanterns bright\nIlluminating pathways in the night.\nA tranquil stroll through Isuien Garden's peace\nA gentle respite troubles find release.\n\n**Day Seventh Osaka's Culinary Delights**\n\nTo Osaka now where flavors brightly gleam\nA culinary paradise a joyful dream.\nDotonbori's lights a vibrant show\nWhere street food vendors tempt and flavors flow.\nOsaka Castle a fortress strong and bold\nA tale of samurai bravely told.\nA farewell feast of takoyaki's grace\nA final taste of Japan's embrace.\n\n**Day Eighth Departure From This Land So Fair**\n\nWith heavy heart and memories to keep\nWe bid farewell to slumber soft and deep.\nFrom Kansai Airport thy vessel takes its flight\nReturning home with visions pure and bright.\nUntil we meet again in lands afar\nMay fortune smile and guide thee like a star.\nFarewell Japan a land of wondrous art\nForever etched within thy grateful heart.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5393308401107788}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.9428325891494751}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0012685356196016073}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.06821470707654953}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.23844066262245178}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.04435490816831589}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -3.2186455882765586e-06}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.03355482220649719}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.11192572116851807}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.047947466373443604}, {"token": "▁quest", "logprob": -0.24266161024570465}, {"t